<title>ESTONIA: MOST STOCKS RISE, TALLINNA PANK LEADS.</title>
<headline>MOST STOCKS RISE, TALLINNA PANK LEADS.</headline>
<text>
<p>* Total trade on Estonian bourse was 44.8 million kroons of shares</p>
<p>* Talse gained 2.57 percent to close on 220.45</p>
<p>* Tallinna Pank was the most active with a gain of 6.60 kroons although selling pressure appeared in the afternoon.</p>
</text>
